(7734897, 1270718, 29535, '<td valign="top">Good to see him again! It''s always tricky to get focus on energetic dogs. It''s not possibile with an iPhone to set the f-stop but remember to leave a little bit more open than you would need with a human due to their big noses :) I''d start at f5.6 with your main camera if you plan on doing something similar and make sure you have a lot of light.<br/> <br/>I look forward to seeing you in future challenges!</td>', 'Good to see him again! It''s always tricky to get focus on energetic dogs. It''s not possibile with an iPhone to set the f-stop but remember to leave a little bit more open than you would need with a human due to their big noses :) I''d start at f5.6 with your main camera if you plan on doing something similar and make sure you have a lot of light. I look forward to seeing you in future challenges!', '2022-12-18 13:30:04.000000', NULL, 0);
